%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 74dd960c52256131fb55915575b01cd9, type: 3}
  m_Name: DeathScreenContent
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GlorifiedBody.UI.DeathScreenContent
  fallback:
    killerId: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: 'PLACEHOLDER: the room from the floor'
    hint: 'PLACEHOLDER HINT: watch the red line and the ring. Step out before it
      closes.'
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 
  entries:
  - killerId: dummy_shooter
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: the padded target from the floor, the gun on its arm, the gym lights
      behind it
    hint: Step out of the red line before the ring closes, then charge. The dummy
      cannot aim twice in a row.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'PRESENTER: And that is why we step out of the circle. Again, from
      the top.'
  - killerId: guard
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: the guard lowering the pistol, the goggles and the respirator filling
      the frame, the laser line going dark
    hint: The red line is where the shot goes. Step out of it before the ring closes.
      Once he has aimed, he cannot aim again.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'GUARD: It''s all right. It''s all right. You''re going back to bed.'
  - killerId: scientist
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: the blue hood from below, the knife, the collar piece with its green
      light
    hint: He aims slowly and his hands shake. Close the distance, or make him come
      to you. The knife is only a knife.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'COMPUTER: Subject contained. Return the tray to the dispensary.'
  - killerId: scientist_group
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: four blue suits around her on the tiles, the ampoules on the floor
    hint: The third light was full. One ampoule before the fight empties it. One
      ampoule during a short ends it.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'COMPUTER: Subject contained. Four personnel to the infirmary.'
  - killerId: soldier
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: the shield from the floor, the gas mask above it, the SMG resting
      on the shield's edge
    hint: 'Behind the shield he is safe. Lift the shield with telekinesis, or stagger
      his aim with a blast, then fire. Two aim at once on normal: dodge the first
      ring, blast the second.'
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'SOLDIER: Target down. Clear. (then, quieter) Was that a kid?'
  - killerId: soldier_pair
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: two shields, two masks, the lobby, the gear on the wall behind them
    hint: Two aim at once on normal. Watch for two rings. Dodge the first. Blast
      the second before his ring closes.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'SOLDIER: Target down. Both of you, check Miller.'
  - killerId: fire
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: the records room burning, her own hand in the flame
    hint: 'Fire spreads. Start it, leave the room, and come back when it is out.
      The firemen fire CO2 canisters at the fire: do not stand in it.'
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'PA: Fire, records. Fire doors are closing. Please remain where you
      are.'
  - killerId: short
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: 'through the slit: her gold-seamed hands open on the black tile,
      the last arc crawling off her fingers into the floor, the ceiling light dead
      above her, the lights of the Crown going out one by one'
    hint: 'A short takes about half your HP: below that, it kills you. With a second
      wind you live, and the short goes on and takes no more HP. A SHORT capsule
      ends it. Every power you use fills the SHORT bar.'
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'PA: Electrical fault, this floor. A member of staff will come to
      you.'
  - killerId: soldier_rifle
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: the rifle's muzzle from the floor, the laser line across her, the
      gas mask above it
    hint: Three rounds follow the laser, a tenth of a second apart. One dodge to
      the side clears the burst. He cannot fire again until he aims again.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'SOLDIER: Three rounds, centre mass. She''s down. Control, she''s
      down.'
  - killerId: soldier_gas
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: 'from the floor: a white cloud, boots in it, a gas mask with round
      lenses looking down'
    hint: The ring shows where it lands. Leave it before the grenade lands, stay
      out of the white cloud, or catch the grenade with mk_orzabal.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'SOLDIER: Knock-out''s working. She''s out. Control, she''s out.'
  - killerId: soldier_grenades
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: the red ring on the floor, her feet in it, the grenade rolling to
      a stop
    hint: A red ring is a grenade. Leave the ring before it closes, or catch the
      grenade with mk_orzabal and send it back.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'SOLDIER: Frag out. (the blast) Clear. Nobody go in there yet.'
  - killerId: power_armour
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: the power armour from the floor, its lenses looking down, the tubes
      of the launcher past its shoulder
    hint: It is too heavy to lift and too armoured to shock. Break its aim with mk_warspite,
      then burn it with mk_erebus. Up close, its launcher will not fire.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'POWER ARMOUR: Subject neutralised. Requesting the recovery team.'
  - killerId: power_armour_launchers
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: the trail of the rocket from the floor, the armour behind it, the
      ceiling coming down
    hint: A rocket follows the laser. Dodge to the side, or catch it with mk_orzabal
      and send it back.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'POWER ARMOUR: Direct hit. Hold fire. Hold fire, she''s down.'
  - killerId: labworker_pistol
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: the lab worker's pistol from the floor, both hands shaking, the
      hood above them
    hint: 'His aim shakes and he can miss. Do not stand still in the circle: one
      step is enough. Close the distance and he drops the aim.'
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'LAB WORKER: I hit her. Computer, I hit her. What do I do now?'
  - killerId: labworker_knife
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: the knife over her, the lab coat behind it, the scalpel light
    hint: The knife runs at you and comes in from the side. Dodge when he raises
      it, then strike. At a distance he is nothing.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'LAB WORKER: Hold still. Hold still, it''s quicker if you hold still.'
  - killerId: labworker
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: the blue hood from below, the scalpel, the collar piece with its
      green light
    hint: 'He aims slowly and his hands shake. Close the distance, or make him come
      to you. Against a group, strike first, from a distance: every hit on you fills
      the SHORT bar.'
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'LAB WORKER: Hold her head. I need the jugular.'
  - killerId: ward_sister
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: red scrubs, the white hood, the pistol held wrong, the card swinging
      on its lanyard
    hint: She fires wide and slowly. Come at her from the side. The card is on her.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'WARD SISTER: I was aiming at the floor. I was aiming at the floor.'
  - killerId: brain
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: the corridor from high above, the brain's eye, Lucy small and bare-headed
      in grey folds
    hint: 'Its ring is slower than your walk: keep moving. When it locks, hurt it
      before the charge fires, or leave the ring. A grabber swells before it lunges:
      step aside.'
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'BRAIN: Your life has been full of suffering. But don''t worry. It''ll
      be over soon.'
  - killerId: halon
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: 'through the slit: server racks in a thin white fog, the red strobe
      of the horn, her hand on the floor one metre short of the panel'
    hint: The horn gives you 30 seconds, and the door seals. Press ABORT on the panel,
      or turn the lockout outside before you light anything. Read the sign.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'PA: Fire suppression complete, server room. A member of staff will
      come to you.'
  - killerId: fireman_gas
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: 'from the floor: a white cloud, a fireman''s mask over her, a gloved
      hand on her neck'
    hint: They fire at the fire. Leave the ring before the canister lands, stay out
      of the white cloud, or catch it with mk_orzabal.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'FIREMAN: I got one breathing! Get a mask on her, get a mask on her!'
  - killerId: power_armour_guns
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    pictureNote: the floor of the Dining Hall from low down, the white linen torn,
      the gun pod of the armour still smoking past its shoulder
    hint: The guns follow the sweep of the laser. Get behind a column before the
      ring fills. Up close, mk_warspite breaks its aim.
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    voiceText: 'POWER ARMOUR: Target down. Cease fire. Cease fire.'
